  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left|a+b \\omega+c \\omega^2\\right|^2=a^2+b^2+c^2-a b-b c-c a$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& =\\frac{1}{2}\\left[(a-b)^2+(b-c)^2+(c-a)^2\\right] \\\\\n& \\therefore \\operatorname{Min}=\\frac{1+1+4}{2}=3 \\quad(a, b, c \\in\\{1,2,3\\})\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
